1
00:00:00,291 --> 00:00:02,794
It's an exciting time to become a visual art teacher

2
00:00:02,794 --> 00:00:03,712
in California.

3
00:00:03,712 --> 00:00:06,506
Single subject art credential program applications

4
00:00:06,506 --> 00:00:08,216
vary at different institutions.

5
00:00:08,258 --> 00:00:11,261
For example, some schools
require a portfolio review

6
00:00:11,261 --> 00:00:13,221
of your own artwork,
while others don't.

7
00:00:13,263 --> 00:00:15,306
So be sure to check
the admissions criteria

8
00:00:15,306 --> 00:00:17,600
for each program to know what you'll need to apply.

9
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:19,644
At minimum, most programs
will ask you

10
00:00:19,644 --> 00:00:21,479
for subject matter competency in art,

11
00:00:21,479 --> 00:00:24,149
early field experiences,
and an interview.

12
00:00:24,149 --> 00:00:25,650
Subject matter competency

13
00:00:25,650 --> 00:00:27,193
is showing
what you know about art.

14
00:00:27,193 --> 00:00:28,945
You can earn a degree in art.

15
00:00:28,945 --> 00:00:30,488
Take the CSET in art.

16
00:00:30,530 --> 00:00:33,575
Complete an approved subject
matter program in art,

17
00:00:33,575 --> 00:00:35,910
or do a combination of the exam and coursework.

18
00:00:35,910 --> 00:00:38,705
Early field experiences
include observations

19
00:00:38,705 --> 00:00:40,415
in K-12 schools
or other settings

20
00:00:40,415 --> 00:00:42,292
where you've observed
or worked with kids.

21
00:00:42,292 --> 00:00:43,043
Once you're in,

22
00:00:43,043 --> 00:00:45,086
there's usually a few different program pathways

23
00:00:45,086 --> 00:00:46,254
that you can choose from.

24
00:00:46,254 --> 00:00:48,882
For example, at CSUN,
we have an accelerated

25
00:00:48,882 --> 00:00:51,509
one-year program as well as the traditional program,

26
00:00:51,509 --> 00:00:54,387
which is about 3 to 4 semesters with student teaching.

27
00:00:54,387 --> 00:00:56,556
We also have an internship
program for people

28
00:00:56,556 --> 00:00:59,100
who can find employment
in a public school setting

29
00:00:59,100 --> 00:01:00,769
while working towards
their credential.

30
00:01:00,769 --> 00:01:02,771
Read through the list
of programs available.

31
00:01:02,771 --> 00:01:05,273
There’s sure to be one out
there that's perfect for you.
